        "title": "Not for the faint at heart",
        "text": "Not sure how to rate this place as it is a crematorium and not really a tourist attraction by any western standards. You are not allowed to visit the hindu temple so you are there only to witness well organized cremation ceremonies.\nEverything there feels almost like a business from Fake Sadhus to self appointed guides making this experience not really a solemn one.\nA good way to get a glimpse on how hindu religion deals with death.period.\nNothing really touristy about that.",
