        "title": "A moving experience",
        "text": "We came to Nepal for a wedding and so going to the principle cremation site on the river was an uncertain choice ... but we were glad we did ! \nThis place is steeped in culture and religious symbolism and although you aren't allowed into the Hindu temple you still see everything from walking around it and observing the process from the opposite side of the river . \nWe appreciated having a guide to inform us of the whole ritual and to indicate when it was appropriate to take pictures of the Holy men etc \nI found it all a moving emotional experience and would allow time to reflect on the scene before you \n ",
