        "title": "Good for visiting only once",
        "text": "This temple has cultural importance for local people and also Hindus all over the world. But it has suffered damage in earthquake and is under reconstruction. The temple premises and the approach road is not at all clean. Very filthy place. \nThere are guides in the temple who start telling you about its history even if you haven't hired them. We met such guy and made it clear in the beginning itself that we won't be paying him anything. He agreed and continued telling us the history and other information about this temple. Once he was done hw started asking for money in the name of God. This doesn't leave a good impression on tourists.",
